sentence_ids.summary_of_the_paper:
This paper proposes a fair clustering algorithm that uses DL models to map the data into deep representations. The authors also show the equivalence between the practical fairness measure and the balance measure. The algorithms can be concluded as two steps: 
1) find fair assignments $\hat y$ based on $y$;
2) tune the latent representations and $y$ according to the pseudo-label $\hat y$.

